==History==
2018 
*The Royal Hogs [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 20/6/2018, in the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]].
*On 27/6/2018, an [[Version History#Optional Update (27/6/2018)|Optional Update]], fixed a bug where the game would crash if the Royal Hogs were hit by area damage when they jumped over the river.
*On 2/7/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/7/2018)|Balance Update]], added the Royal Hogs to [[Clan Wars]] [[Clan Wars/Clan Wars I|Collection Day]] card pool.
*On 6/8/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/8/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Hogs' first attack time interval to 0.1 seconds (from 0.75 seconds).
*On 3/9/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/9/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Hogs' attack time interval to 1.2 seconds (from 1.1 seconds) and their first attack time interval to 0.25 seconds (from 0.1 seconds).
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11).
*On 5/11/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/11/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Hogs' damage by 6%, and decreased their mass to 2 (from 4).
2019
*On 4/11/2019, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/11/2019)|Balance Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock this card from Hog Mountain to Royal Arena.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], removed the Royal Hogs from [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Mega Deck]] [[Touchdown]]. It also added a card render to the Royal Hogs' card info screen.
2020  
*On 4/2/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/2/2020)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Hogs' damage by 6%.
2021
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Royal Hogs' damage by 6%.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022 
*On 3/2/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(3/2/2022)|Balance Update]], decreased the Royal Hogs' damage by 3%.
*On 4/10/2022, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/10/2022)|Balance Update]], increased the Royal Hogs' first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.25 seconds).
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 3/11/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (3/11/2025)|November 2025]], added the Royal Hogs' Evolution.

